@startuml
' Set the size to fit A4 portrait mode (8.27 inches x 11.69 inches)
actor User

' --- Parking Search Use Cases ---
(Find Nearby Parking by Geolocation) as FindNearbyParkingGeo
(Find Nearby Parking by Address) as FindNearbyParkingAddr
(Get Available Parking Spaces) as GetAvailableSpaces

' --- Booking Use Cases ---
(Confirm Booking) as ConfirmBooking
(Cancel Booking) as CancelBooking

' Structuring Use Cases for Portrait Layout
User -right-> CancelBooking
User -right-> ConfirmBooking
User -right-> GetAvailableSpaces
User -right-> FindNearbyParkingGeo
User -right-> FindNearbyParkingAddr

@enduml